        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/858c86/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-16T16:26:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like (but I'm guessing my gaming buddies hate) the turns toward the end of a game with AZ with two Impales and a Cold Snap out plus Focussed Apertures and any miscellaneous damage buffs where I've done enough cold damage before my play phase that I have to really think about how to deal damage with my one shots and Thermal Shockwave to not kill myself.&nbsp;</p>",
